== r3.92 (D4): Std.SystemUtils. Run without arguments, ParamCount is 0 and
== ParamStr(0) is the program; PATH is set on every system the suite runs on;
== Halt(0) ends the program at once with status 0.
Use Std.SystemUtils

Main :
    PutLn(ParamCount, " ", ParamStr(0) # "", " ", EnvExists("PATH"), " ", GetEnv("PATH") # "")
    PutLn(EnvExists("INOX_NOT_SET_IN_ANY_TEST"), " [", GetEnv("INOX_NOT_SET_IN_ANY_TEST"), "]")
    Known := PlatformName = "Linux" or PlatformName = "Windows" or PlatformName = "macOS" or PlatformName = "FreeBSD"
    PutLn(Known, " ", CurrentDir # "")
    Sleep(5)
    Put("halting")
    Halt(0)
    PutLn(" never")
;
